      "Bash(gh pr create --base develop --head feature-tferguson-edit-posters --title \"$\\(cat <<''EOF''\nAdd Collection and Item Poster Editing Functionality\nEOF\n\\)\" --body \"$\\(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\nThis PR adds comprehensive poster and metadata editing capabilities for both Plex collections and individual library items \\(movies/shows\\).\n\n### Collection Editing Features\n- **Quick Edit Modal** on Collections page - Edit collection name, summary, and poster from the collections list\n- **Advanced Edit Modal** on Collection Detail page - Full collection metadata editing including:\n  - Title and Summary\n  - Sort Title and Content Rating\n  - Labels management\n  - Collection Mode \\(hide/show options\\)\n  - Collection Order \\(release/alpha/custom\\)\n  - Poster upload \\(file or URL\\)\n\n### Item Poster Editing\n- **Edit Poster Button** on collection items - Blue edit button in top-left corner \\(shown on hover\\)\n- **Item Poster Modal** - Upload or paste URL for individual movie/show posters\n- Supports both file uploads and URL inputs \\(ThePosterDB, TMDB, etc.\\)\n\n### Technical Implementation\n\n**Frontend Changes:**\n- [CollectionsPage.tsx]\\(homescreen-hero-ui/src/pages/CollectionsPage.tsx\\) - Quick edit modal with two-column layout\n- [CollectionDetailPage.tsx]\\(homescreen-hero-ui/src/pages/CollectionDetailPage.tsx\\) - Advanced edit modal and item poster editing\n- Consistent modal design with tab switchers for upload/URL modes\n- Uppercase labels with tracking for professional appearance\n\n**Backend Changes:**\n- [collections.py]\\(homescreen_hero/web/routers/collections.py\\) - New endpoints:\n  - `PUT /{library}/{collection_title}` - Update collection metadata\n  - `POST /{library}/{collection_title}/upload-poster` - Upload collection poster\n  - `POST /{library}/items/{rating_key}/upload-poster` - Upload item poster\n- Proper cache invalidation for immediate poster updates\n- Support for both file uploads and URL-based poster updates\n\n### User Experience\n- Hover over any collection/item poster to reveal edit buttons\n- Clean two-column modal layout \\(poster preview left, fields right\\)\n- Tab-style switcher between file upload and URL input\n- Real-time validation and feedback\n- Automatic page refresh after successful updates\n\n### Test Plan\n- [x] Collection quick edit from collections list\n- [x] Collection advanced edit from detail page\n- [x] Item poster editing from collection items\n- [x] File upload for all poster types\n- [x] URL upload for all poster types\n- [x] Cache invalidation verification\n- [x] Frontend build passes\n- [x] Backend syntax validation passes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code]\\(https://claude.com/claude-code\\)\nEOF\n\\)\")",
