      "Bash(gh pr create --base develop --title \"Fix: Manual Plex collections being deleted during cleanup\" --body \"$\\(cat <<''EOF''\n## Bug: Manual Plex collections being deleted during cleanup\n\n**Expected:**\nWhen a collection is manually created in Plex and added to a group in `config.yaml`, it should persist and be used in rotations. The cleanup logic should only remove collections from deleted integration sources \\(Trakt/Letterboxd/MDBList\\) that are no longer referenced in the config.\n\n**Actual:**\nManual Plex collections that were added to groups in `config.yaml` were being deleted from Plex during the `cleanup_deleted_integration_sources\\(\\)` process. The app incorrectly assumed that ANY collection in rotation history that wasn''t in current integration sources must be a \"deleted integration source\" and would delete it from Plex.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n1. Create a collection manually in Plex \\(e.g., \"My Custom Collection\"\\)\n2. Add it to a group in `config.yaml`\n3. Run a rotation - collection appears and rotates correctly\n4. Run another rotation or sync\n5. The manual collection gets deleted from Plex unexpectedly\n\n**Root Cause:**\nThe cleanup logic was using: `deleted_sources = previously_rotated - current_integration_sources`\n\nThis meant any collection that was rotated but not from an integration source \\(i.e., manual Plex collections\\) would be marked for deletion.\n\n**Fix:**\nUpdated the cleanup logic to: `deleted_sources = previously_rotated - current_integration_sources - group_collections`\n\nNow the function only deletes collections if they meet ALL criteria:\n1. Previously rotated \\(in history\\)\n2. NOT in current integration sources \\(source was removed\\)\n3. NOT in current groups \\(not a manual collection\\)\n\nIf a collection is still in a group, it will NEVER be deleted, regardless of whether it has an integration source. This preserves:\n- Manual Plex collections added to groups\n- Integration-backed collections that will be synced later\n\n**Changes:**\n- Updated `cleanup_deleted_integration_sources\\(\\)` in `plex_client.py`\n- Added detailed comments explaining the logic\n- Removed auto-update config functionality \\(no longer needed since we preserve manual collections\\)\n- Updated function docstring to reflect new behavior\n\n**Testing:**\n- Manual collections in groups are preserved ✓\n- Deleted integration sources \\(removed from config entirely\\) are still cleaned up ✓\n- Collections that exist in both integration sources and groups are preserved ✓\n\nFixes the issue where manual Plex collections were being unexpectedly deleted.\nEOF\n\\)\")",
